      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRAVE ART (8) was in the money two runs ago then improved sharply at her latest appearance over 2190m at this track, scoring comfortably by 5.5 metres after being handy all the way. No harm in drawing here with the sprint lane to rely upon. Big chance in this comparable race. ANIMADO (6) filled a minor placing at Melton two runs ago before finishing second at his latest appearance over 2180m at Kilmore, beaten 1.5 metres. Perfectly placed and is sure to play a major role. MY FATAL CHARM (10) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when she finished second at this track over 1690m. BETTOR DOO NZ (3) cannot be left out after solid recent performances, the latest a sound second at St Arnaud over 2150m.",
